{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Everyday Things"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Are You on Time?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "Beginner"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Time"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the words <span class=\"strong\"> before</span> and <span class=\"strong\">after</span> to talk about the order of events. <br/><br/> You use the word <span class=\"strong\">around</span> to talk about when something happens in a non-specific way.  <br/><br/>You use <span class=\"strong\"> from ... to</span> to talk about  when an event starts and ends."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> before </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le04ob10img01.png\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I get to work before 9:00 every day. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> after</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le04ob10img02.png\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I usually get to the office after 9:00 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> around </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le04ob10img03.png\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I take the bus around 9 a.m. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> from ... to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn1le04ob10img04.png\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Every morning I drive from 9 to 10. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example Dialogue</span>: <br /><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I get to work before 9:00 every day. \u00a0<br /> <span class=\"strong\">Theresa</span>: I usually get to the office after 10:00 a.m. <br /><span class=\"strong\">Nancy</span>: We arrive around 9:00. <br /> <span class=\"strong\">Ted</span>: Lunch break is from 1:00 to 2:00 every day. </span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "early"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "before a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I take the 7 a.m. bus because I like to get to the office early."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about time."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "late"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "after a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My bus usually leaves late, so I get to work after 10 a.m. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I get to the office on time every morning, at exactly 9 a.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "before"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at a time earlier than a specific time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to arrive early at the office, so I get up before 7 a.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "after"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at a time later than a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I get home after 6 p.m. because there is always a lot of traffic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "around"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "close to a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I usually get to the office on time, around 9 a.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to arrive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What time do you get to the office in the morning?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coffee break"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short rest from work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to take a coffee break after 10:00 a.m."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le04ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Express information about  daily or weekly routine in a very simple way."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Completes simple dialogu